PART 2: THE CHALLENGE REQUIREMENTS

================================================================================

Challenge Description

Your task is to build a UserProfile Card component that displays user information in a professional card format.

This is a common pattern used in real applications like LinkedIn, Twitter, GitHub, and many other platforms.

Requirement 1: Display User Information

The card must show:

• User's full name • User's email address • User's job title or role • User's profile picture/avatar • User's bio or short description • Date when user joined

Requirement 2: Interactive Features

The card should:

• Display multiple user cards on the same page • Have professional styling with hover effects • Be responsive (work on mobile and desktop) • Show action buttons for future functionality

Requirement 3: Component Structure

You need to create:

• A main App component that manages the user data • A UserProfileCard child component that displays individual user information • Make the card component reusable so it works with any user data

Requirement 4: Data Handling

Your app should:

• Store user data in state using useState • Pass user data to child components via Props • Render multiple cards using map() with proper keys • Handle empty state (show message if no users)

